NOTE ON REFERENCE DATA PROVENANCE

The text data files under database_files/ are shared SWAT+ reference records.
They are serialized from the official SWAT+ Editor reference dataset
(swat-model/swatplus-editor: swatplus_datasets.sqlite), with a few supplemental
files documented in metadata/external_sources.json. This MIT license covers the
repository's tooling, metadata, and workflow. Reuse of the underlying scientific
data should also credit the original SWAT+ project and the sources recorded in
the provenance metadata.
